#: ../../../README.md:31 605982d1ce0e417aa22cfafdfa5f2eab
msgid ""
"v4.0.0 的界面工具（轨道族生成、轨道库浏览）是纯 CR3BP 计算，不需要 SPICE 内核。轨道设计、轨道保持等星历工具的界面正在回归（见"
" [issue #398](https://github.com/cislunarspace/transfer-orbit-"
"design/issues/398)）；回归后需要行星历 `.bsp` 等内核，获取方式："
msgstr "The v4.0.0 UI tools (orbit family generation, catalog browsing) are pure CR3BP computations and need no SPICE kernels. Ephemeris tools such as orbit design and station keeping are returning to the UI (see [issue #398](https://github.com/cislunarspace/transfer-orbit-design/issues/398)); once available they need the planetary ephemeris `.bsp` and friends, obtainable via:"

#: ../../../README.md:33 057ad67ee0584c0ea16b6feafa136b6a
msgid "**自动下载（推荐）**：`uv run python scripts/download_kernels.py`，幂等拉取到 `kernels/`；"
msgstr "**Automatic download (recommended)**: `uv run python scripts/download_kernels.py` — idempotently fetches everything into `kernels/`;"

#: ../../../README.md:34 5ba8509dc06849749e240071d4d8afc4
msgid ""
"**手动下载**：从 e2m2e 的 [`kernels-v1` "
"release](https://github.com/cislunarspace/e2m2e/releases) 解压到 "
"`kernels/`（sidecar 工作目录下的相对路径）；"
msgstr "**Manual download**: extract e2m2e's [`kernels-v1` release](https://github.com/cislunarspace/e2m2e/releases) into `kernels/` (relative to the sidecar working directory);"

#: ../../../README.md:35 a9d53e3f1a544953a5b15fbcec80d044
msgid "**自备数据**：`$SPICE_KERNEL_DIR` 指向已有内核目录（优先级最高）。"
msgstr "**Bring your own**: point `$SPICE_KERNEL_DIR` at an existing kernel directory (highest priority)."

#: ../../../README.md:37 20710498d72e467cba5f5f30bcf05709
msgid "官方来源：[NASA NAIF](https://naif.jpl.nasa.gov/naif/data.html)（备用）。"
msgstr "Official source: [NASA NAIF](https://naif.jpl.nasa.gov/naif/data.html) (fallback)."

#: ../../../README.md:39 44829e6d53e74b25b29316aef8931d92
msgid "快速开始"
msgstr "Quick Start"

#: ../../../README.md:41 d18c87a85fe2437680558a825e075f00
msgid "启动后左栏默认「项目」页签；切到「轨道库」页签自动加载全库，过滤栏可按族类型、平动点、Jacobi 与振幅区间、标签组合筛选。"
msgstr "The left column opens on the \"Project\" tab; switch to the \"Catalog\" tab to load the whole orbit library, with a filter bar combining family type, libration point, Jacobi and amplitude ranges, and tags."

#: ../../../README.md:42 b48e2404b54140488000ab4d538013c3
msgid ""
"中栏「轨道族生成」：选族类型（Halo / NRHO / Axial / Lissajous / SPO / LPO / Horseshoe / "
"DRO），按族显示对应参数（振幅上下限、近月点高度、相位等），点「生成」。"
msgstr "The middle column is \"Orbit Family Generation\": pick a family (Halo / NRHO / Axial / Lissajous / SPO / LPO / Horseshoe / DRO); the panel shows the family-specific parameters (amplitude bounds, perilune height, phases, …). Click \"Generate\"."

#: ../../../README.md:43 9c430c54f41842d3a9858517474c64ff
msgid "族成员轨迹随即出现在右侧画布：左键拖拽旋转、滚轮缩放；「适配」按钮按轨迹包围盒复位视角。点击轨道库记录可把库轨迹叠加到画布。"
msgstr "Member trajectories appear on the canvas at once: drag to rotate, scroll to zoom; the \"Fit\" button recentres on the trajectory bounding box. Clicking a catalog record overlays its trajectories on the canvas."

#: ../../../README.md:44 c07140dc11684e48bf6c959a1e536cfe
msgid "左栏右上角语言切换中英界面。"
msgstr "The language switcher at the top of the left column toggles between Chinese and English."

#: ../../../README.md:46 37906ef7cab34dfe8ff89a8124aa9f04
msgid "能力"
msgstr "Capabilities"

#: ../../../README.md:48 b8613f0905794ebdb502e9a23e088e0c
msgid "**v4.0.0 界面可用**"
msgstr "**Available in the v4.0.0 UI**"

#: ../../../README.md:50 5ea334da8e294f93b653b087b067152c
msgid ""
"**轨道族生成**：八族（七族 + DRO）周期延拓/参数采样，参数表单由工具的 JSON Schema 自动生成（字段裁剪、范围与默认值随 "
"e2m2e 模型走）；进度实时显示，成员轨迹逐条渲染。"
msgstr "**Orbit family generation**: eight families (the seven classic ones + DRO), periodic continuation or parameter sampling; the parameter form is generated from the tool's JSON Schema (field pruning, ranges and defaults follow the e2m2e models); live progress; member trajectories rendered one by one."

#: ../../../README.md:51 af41d6a8efb945f9a11e516196f94c0b
msgid "**轨道库浏览**：产物自动入 e2m2e 轨道库（catalog 多维分类），多维过滤查询，选中记录叠加画布。"
msgstr "**Catalog browsing**: products are stored automatically in the e2m2e orbit library (multi-dimensional catalog); filtered queries; clicking a record overlays it on the canvas."

#: ../../../README.md:52 2aec99a87fe5412a96bbd470946cfffa
msgid ""
"**画布**：Three.js 3D 视图，视图适配与视图保持、地月与平动点标注、图表设置（线宽/天体与平动点标注/Z 轴比例）持久化、webm "
"动画导出。"
msgstr "**Canvas**: Three.js 3D view with view-fit and view-preservation, Earth/Moon and libration-point annotations, persisted chart settings (line width, body/point markers, Z-axis ratio), webm animation export."

#: ../../../README.md:54 c574e85a68a547f2addf78d3d7886a9b
msgid ""
"**尚未接线**（v3.2.3 PyQt 版曾发布，Tauri 版逐工具回归中，见 [issue "
"#398](https://github.com/cislunarspace/transfer-orbit-"
"design/issues/398)）：轨道设计、轨道保持、轨道预报、转移设计、稳定性分析、时空坐标转换。需要这些工具请使用 v3.2.3 或 "
"e2m2e CLI。"
msgstr "**Not yet wired** (shipped in the v3.2.3 PyQt UI; returning tool by tool on Tauri — see [issue #398](https://github.com/cislunarspace/transfer-orbit-design/issues/398)): orbit design, station keeping, orbit propagation, transfer design, stability analysis, spacetime transform. Use v3.2.3 or the e2m2e CLI if you need them now."

#: ../../../README.md:56 a74905bc127e414c9db3b2de119da102
msgid "数据流与产物"
msgstr "Data Flow and Artifacts"

#: ../../../README.md:58 288d398abc86493d8e2ae498614d0d65
msgid ""
"一次计算的数据流：参数表单 → Rust 命令 → e2m2e sidecar（JSON 行信封 + 二进制帧，e2m2e ADR 0035）→ "
"产物自动入轨道库 → 项目树/画布经 `catalog_query` / `catalog_get` 取用。"
msgstr "One computation flows: parameter form → Rust command → e2m2e sidecar (JSON-line envelopes + binary frames, e2m2e ADR 0035) → product lands in the orbit library automatically → project tree / canvas fetch it via `catalog_query` / `catalog_get`."

#: ../../../README.md:60 820d3e4543db4f058827e5e1cf61f646
msgid ""
"产物持久化在 `catalog/` 目录（开发期仓库根 `catalog/`；安装版在安装目录下）。轨道库是 e2m2e catalog "
"格式（多维分类、谱系指针），可以直接被 e2m2e 或其他宿主打开；`output/` 仅保留转移遗留分区与脚本场景。"
msgstr "Products persist in the `catalog/` directory (repo root in development; the install directory for the packaged app). The library is the e2m2e catalog format (multi-dimensional classification, lineage pointers) and can be opened directly by e2m2e or other hosts; `output/` only keeps the legacy transfer partition and script workflows."

